---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import logo from '../assets/stone-cube-logo.svg';
import { SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';

const today = new Date();
---

<footer>
	<div class="wrap">
		<div class="foot-grid">
			<div class="foot-brand">
				<a class="brand" href="/"><Image src={logo} alt="" width={30} height={30} />{SITE_TITLE}</a>
				<p>Astuces concrètes pour tirer le meilleur parti des agents de coding au quotidien.</p>
			</div>
			<div>
				<h4>Navigation</h4>
				<ul>
					<li><a href="/">Accueil</a></li>
					<li><a href="/blog">Blog</a></li>
					<li><a href="/tutoriels">Tutoriels</a></li>
					<li><a href="/about">À propos de moi</a></li>
				</ul>
			</div>
			<div>
				<h4>Tutoriels</h4>
				<ul>
					<li><a href="/tutoriels/sos-php/">Faille PHP 2026-10-21</a></li>
					<li><a href="/tutoriels/php2shell/" hreflang="en">PHP vulnerability 2026-10-21 (EN)</a></li>
				</ul>
			</div>
			<div>
				<h4>Suivre</h4>
				<ul>
					<li><a href="https://x.com/px_ia_95" target="_blank">X</a></li>
					<li><a href="https://github.com/stonetech-pxia" target="_blank">GitHub</a></li>
					<li><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/xia-pengda-830589212" target="_blank">LinkedIn</a></li>
					<li><a href="/rss.xml">Flux RSS</a></li>
				</ul>
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class="foot-bottom">
			<span>&copy; {today.getFullYear()} Stone Tech. All rights reserved.</span>
		</div>
	</div>
</footer>
<style>
	footer {
		margin-top: 104px;
		padding-block: 56px 40px;
		border-top: 1px solid var(--divider);
	}
	.foot-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1.6fr repeat(3, 1fr);
		gap: 32px;
	}
	.brand {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 10px;
		color: var(--ink);
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-size: var(--t-lg);
		font-weight: 700;
		letter-spacing: -0.02em;
		text-decoration: none;
	}
	.brand img {
		border-radius: 0;
		filter: none;
	}
	.foot-brand p {
		max-width: 32ch;
		margin: 12px 0 0;
		color: var(--ink-muted);
		font-size: var(--t-sm);
	}
	h4 {
		margin: 0 0 12px;
		font-size: var(--t-sm);
		font-weight: 600;
	}
	ul {
		display: grid;
		gap: 8px;
		margin: 0;
		padding: 0;
		font-size: var(--t-sm);
		list-style: none;
	}
	ul a {
		color: var(--ink-muted);
		text-decoration: none;
	}
	ul a:hover {
		color: var(--ink);
	}
	.foot-bottom {
		display: flex;
		justify-content: space-between;
		gap: 16px;
		margin-top: 48px;
		padding-top: 20px;
		color: var(--ink-caption);
		font-size: var(--t-sm);
		border-top: 1px solid var(--divider);
	}
	@media (max-width: 760px) {
		footer {
			margin-top: 72px;
		}
		.foot-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
		}
		.foot-brand {
			grid-column: span 2;
		}
	}
</style>
